From c78ca544a06f0036a40aeae26c70580e4cb7a22a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:42:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Android: survive surface churn during loads + SP
 cheat-cvar noise

- V_RenderVGuiOnly: pump SDL's Android window/surface machinery while the
  engine paints loading screens (the frame loop - and with it the only
  pump - does not run during a synchronous map load)
- CSDLMgr::ShowPixels: self-heal a failed present by re-binding the GL
  context to the window's recreated EGL surface and retrying, so a surface
  replacement mid-load cannot leave a permanent dead renderer
- SCR_UpdateScreen: keep painting the loading UI on Android during SP
  loads (the compositor does not keep our stale frame alive like a desktop
  window does)
- Host_IsSinglePlayerGame: trust the loading local server's maxclients so
  the fog controller's cheat-flagged cvars are not refused (and re-refused
  after every sv_cheats reset) during map spawn
